# PROBE intersection-lhs. B ⊓ C ⊑ D with A ⊑ B and A ⊑ C entails A ⊑ D; B alone does not reach D.
# construct: ObjectIntersectionOf
# expect: sub :A :D
# expect-not: sub :B :D

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:A rdfs:subClassOf :B , :C .
[ a owl:Class ; owl:intersectionOf ( :B :C ) ] rdfs:subClassOf :D .
